# Texts that may not be public before their release date (Murray's Euripides: 2028-01-01).
# Generated from pipeline/anagnosis_pipeline/private.py (PRIVATE_SLUGS); `check` reports a missing line.
# Their files live in private/ (its own git repository); texts/<slug> and
# pipeline/transcriptions/drama/<slug> are links into it. data/catalog-author.json lists every text.
